Upstream-Name: howdy-next
Source: https://github.com/nathawatc/howdy-next
Comment: The opencv/ and yyjson/ source components are built into the package but are not
 part of howdy-next itself. The OpenCV libraries statically contain protobuf, mlas, and JasPer
 from opencv/3rdparty. The face models are downloaded at run time, not shipped; see
 THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for their licenses.

